2438	
2439	4. Security Assessment
2440	   - Highlight potential security exposures
2441	   - Identify systems with known vulnerabilities
2442	   - Note outdated software versions
2443	   - Document unusual port or service combinations
2444	
2445	Present findings in a structured report focused on the internet-facing assets discovered through Shodan.`
2446	        }
2447	      }]
