2540	// Internet Search Prompt (Uses Shodan API)
2541	/**
2542	 * Internet Search Prompt (Uses Shodan API)
2543	 * A guided workflow for searching and analyzing specific types of
2544	 * internet-connected systems or services. Helps construct effective
2545	 * Shodan search queries and analyze results.
